⭐ Day 14 in One Sentence

Ingress provides routing rules for external HTTP/HTTPS traffic, while an Ingress Controller implements those rules and routes requests to the appropriate Kubernetes Services.

🔑 Quick Memory Trick
INGRESS       → Routing rules
CONTROLLER    → Implements rules
HOSTNAME      → Helps decide where traffic goes
SERVICE       → Sends traffic to Pods

Or even simpler:

Ingress = WHAT
Ingress Controller = HOW
Routing = WHERE

